          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Action: Wait 1 day. Why: Gives lead time to read or review the resource.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Step 5: Send Value Email</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Action: Send Email. Purpose: Give one useful tip related to the offer. Example topic: The biggest mistake people make after capturing a lead.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Step 6: Wait 2 Days</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Action: Wait 2 days. Build anticipation for the next message.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Step 7: Soft Call-to-Action</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Action: Send Email. Purpose: Invite lead to take the next step. Example: Would you like help setting this up? Book a quick session here.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Point -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-amber-400">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">Key Point</h3>
        <p class="text-amber-800 text-lg">The follow-up workflow is where LeadProspectrr saves time and prevents leads from being missed. Set up tags, notifications, confirmation emails, and a nurture sequence.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Action Steps -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-emerald-200">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900">Action Steps — Test the Funnel</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Create the Workflow</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">In LeadProspectrr, create a new workflow triggered by your form submission.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Add Tag Step</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Add a tag to identify where this lead came from. Example: Funnel - Simple Lead Capture</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Set Up Notifications</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Configure internal notifications so you or your team know when new leads arrive.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">4</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Write Confirmation Email</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Create an email that confirms their request and delivers the promised resource.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">5</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Add Follow-Up Emails</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Create 2-3 additional emails with value and soft calls-to-action.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>',
      title = 'Build the Follow-Up Workflow',
      lesson_number = 6,
      sort_order = 6,
      updated_at = NOW()
    WHERE id = v_lesson_id;
    
    RAISE NOTICE 'Updated lesson: Build the Follow-Up Workflow';
  END IF;

END $$;


-- Insert Quiz Questions for Lesson: Build the Follow-Up Workflow

DO $$
DECLARE
  v_module_id UUID;
  v_lesson_id UUID;
  v_quiz_id UUID;
BEGIN
  -- Get Module by week number
  SELECT id INTO v_module_id FROM public.training_modules WHERE week_number = 8 LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_module_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Module 8 not found';
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  -- Get the lesson ID
  SELECT id INTO v_lesson_id 
  FROM public.lessons 
  WHERE slug = 'build-follow-up-workflow' AND module_id = v_module_id;
  
  IF v_lesson_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Lesson build-follow-up-workflow not found in module 8';
    RETURN;
  END IF;
  
  -- Delete existing quizzes to avoid duplicates
  DELETE FROM public.lesson_quizzes WHERE lesson_id = v_lesson_id;


  -- Question 1
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What should be the first step in a follow-up workflow?', 
    '["Send a sales pitch immediately","Add a tag to identify where the lead came from","Delete the lead","Wait one week"]'::jsonb,
    'Add a tag to identify where the lead came from',
    'The first step should be adding a tag. This helps you identify the lead source and segment your contacts for appropriate follow-up.', 
    1
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 2
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'Why send an internal notification?', 
    '["To spam your team","So the business owner or team knows a new lead came in","It is required by law","To charge the lead money"]'::jsonb,
    'So the business owner or team knows a new lead came in',
    'Internal notifications alert you or your team when new leads come in, ensuring timely follow-up and preventing leads from being missed.', 
    2
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 3
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What is the purpose of the confirmation email?', 
    '["To sell them immediately","To confirm the request and deliver the promised resource","To ask for more information","To unsubscribe them"]'::jsonb,
    'To confirm the request and deliver the promised resource',
    'The confirmation email serves two purposes: it confirms their request was received and delivers the promised resource (checklist, guide, etc.).', 
    3
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;

END $$;
